-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundled fonts — NOT covered by the MIT license above
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The builds of this project bundle two music fonts, which the MIT license above
does not apply to and cannot: they are licensed under the SIL Open Font License,
Version 1.1, whose clause 5 requires that the Font Software not be distributed
under any other license.

  Bravura 1.392 and Academico 0.902
  Copyright (c) Steinberg Media Technologies GmbH (http://www.steinberg.net/),
  with Reserved Font Names "Bravura" and "Academico".
  Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1:
  https://scripts.sil.org/OFL

They come from the `@vexflow-fonts/bravura` and `@vexflow-fonts/academico`
packages. Each font's full license text and upstream provenance ship with the
build under `dist/fonts/<font>/`, and can be read in the installed packages at
`node_modules/@vexflow-fonts/<font>/LICENSE.txt`.

Exported SVGs embed these fonts and carry the notice above; exported PNGs are
rasterized and contain no font data.
